WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:04,590
This Mrs. Li is simply crazy.

2
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,030
Li Qingshan is his biological son

3
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,630
How could he have the heart to come here and steal the family property now?

4
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:10,430
This old woman has always loved the second and third children in her heart.

5
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:11,390
Just an old scalper

6
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:12,910
Now the old scalper looks useless

7
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:13,870
I must kill and eat meat

8
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:15,470
Mrs. Li and Zhang Qiuyue used to be a couple

9
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:16,670
Ability to maintain superficial harmony

10
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,310
That's because we still expect them to make money.

11
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:20,990
How could he be like this when the palms and backs of his hands are all flesh? Who knows?

12
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:23,190
Then Li Qing and Li Qingyun are not good people either. I feed a dog.

13
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:24,430
The dog will still wag its tail when it sees me, right?

14
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:26,190
The two brothers’ finances for marrying their wives and the money to build a house

15
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,550
They were all given by Li Qingshan and his wife.

16
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,150
This is raising two white-eyed wolves.

17
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:33,510
This Mrs. Li is simply crazy, boss

18
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:34,870
It’s not that my mother doesn’t feel sorry for you

19
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:35,990
But look at your legs yourself

20
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:36,990
It's all dark

21
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:39,750
I heard people say you were bitten by the devil's tongue and waited for the poison to attack your heart.

22
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:42,310
You won't be able to survive if you talk about killing Yufu

23
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:43,510
Originally he was the ancestor of our old Li family

24
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:45,390
Since you can’t use the heirloom passed down,

25
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:47,150
Then give it to your two younger brothers, mother.

26
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,270
You have to speak with your conscience

27
00:00:48,270 --> 00:00:49,430
The one who killed Yufu was our old Li family

28
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:50,390
Good things left by our ancestors

29
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:52,470
But she was passed down to me by my grandfather

30
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:54,990
You are forcing me to give each of my two brothers a hundred yuan.

31
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:55,910
The cost of buying Duansha Yufu

32
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:57,070
I also took the photo

33
00:00:57,070 --> 00:01:00,670
Sha Yufu can give it to you, but you have to pay back the two hundred yuan I gave you.

34
00:01:00,670 --> 00:01:03,730
Then give Qiuyue five hundred yuan and more

35
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:05,410
All the house brothers after my death

36
00:01:05,410 --> 00:01:06,610
Leave it all to Zhang Qiuyue and my son

37
00:01:06,610 --> 00:01:07,730
Regardless of whether Qiuyue changes the price or stays

38
00:01:07,730 --> 00:01:09,370
None of you can interfere with this

39
00:01:09,370 --> 00:01:12,380
What did you say? Qiuyue

40
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,900
Since I can't live anymore

41
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:15,820
I have to leave a guarantee for you and your children.

42
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:18,620
Li Qingshan’s request is not too much, right?

43
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:19,620
Not to mention killing Yufu

44
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:21,060
It was her own

45
00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:22,020
Just say these years

46
00:01:22,020 --> 00:01:23,380
What she invested in her two younger brothers

47
00:01:23,380 --> 00:01:24,780
Far more than five hundred

48
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:26,660
Now let them give back a little kindness and reason

49
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:29,800
Everything is normal, bro

50
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:31,400
Sha Yufu originally belonged to our family.

51
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,320
We use our own stuff

52
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,480
Still need to give money

53
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:35,520
The house and my brother were left to a widower

54
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:36,800
Brother, are you confused?

55
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:39,000
That's the foundation of our Li family. Don't even think about it.
